msgctxt "64"
msgid "Please, stop it! Leave my son alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Tatsuo, if... if it'll really stop your pain, you can kill me. Just leave "
"him out of it... I'm the one who abandoned you all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You don't have to go that far. Please⑬have mercy on him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Please, Tatsuo, listen. All that debt was too much for me to take... I felt "
"like all I could do was run."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I knew my business... I knew what would happen to my family if I left them "
"with my debts. Of course I knew..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"I don't know what I was thinking... I never thought about how all my "
"strongarm tactics would come back to haunt me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"And now... after a decade of being on the run... I'm just a broken, "
"homeless, sad old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "All I wanted was to see you one more time... before I'm finally gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I needed to see you... I needed you to know how sorry I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"I know I can't ask you to forgive me. I just... needed to apologize to "
"you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Dad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"...From the very beginning, I thought I had to kill you. I thought what "
"you'd done was unforgivable. But still, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Tatsuo..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "I... I wanted to see you one more time, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Tatsuo... I'm so sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid ""
"Heheh... A humble family, torn apart by a legendary yakuza... Now that's a "
"story. And I got the shots to sell it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Sorry, but this is just too good to pass up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Write it up, put it in a magazine. Whatever. I don't care."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Really now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"I won't run, and I won't hide. If I really did ruin this family, go ahead "
"and tell the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Hirata and his son are making peace. That's enough for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "See you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "You got 8,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

